# Tableau{{ variant_label }} for Amazon Quick

Amazon Quick has no plugin format, so Tableau is set up in two parts:

1. a **connector** to the Tableau MCP server, which gives Quick the Tableau
   tools; and
2. the **Tableau skills**, which teach Quick how to use them.

| Path | What it is |
|---|---|
| `connector/mcp.json` | MCP server config for the connector |
| `tableau-skills.zip` | every skill below, one folder each |
| `skills/<skill>/` | the same skills, unzipped |

Each skill folder is self-contained: its `SKILL.md` plus the references and
scripts it uses.

